            <div xml:id="d124">

                <pb facs="0200" n="166" xml:id="pg166"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">No. 124.</note>
                <head>Mr. Motley to Mr.
                        Fish.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 474.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Legation of the United
                                States,</hi><hi rendition="#italic"> London</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1870-10-01"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >October</hi> 1, 1870</date>. (Received October 14,
                        1870.)</dateline></opener>
                <p>I have the honor to send herewith copies of the report of M. Jules Favre
                    concerning his recent interview with Count Bismarck as they appear in the London
                    papers of the day.</p>


                <xi:include href="d124-a1.xml" xpointer="d124-a1"/>
